            "value": "I'm challenging you to a duel in reInspire ⚔️ Whoever completes more tasks wins. Code: %@. Download: https://thechallenges.app"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je te défie en duel sur reInspire ⚔️ Celui qui accomplit le plus de tâches gagne. Code : %@. Télécharge : https://thechallenges.app"
